var e=[{key:`Academics`,blurb:`Core science and mathematics foundations`},{key:`Technology`,blurb:`Computing, data and digital craft`},{key:`Business`,blurb:`Enterprise, money and markets`},{key:`Design & Communication`,blurb:`Visual and professional communication`},{key:`Life & Wellbeing`,blurb:`Habits, health and personal effectiveness`}],t=[{slug:`mathematics`,code:`01`,title:`Mathematics`,description:`Build confidence with numbers, patterns, equations, and practical problem-solving. Learners develop mathematical reasoning and apply core concepts to everyday and academic situations.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Academics`,modules:[`Number systems, arithmetic, and estimation`,`Fractions, ratios, percentages, and proportions`,`Algebraic expressions and linear equations`,`Geometry, measurement, and spatial reasoning`,`Functions, graphs, and coordinate geometry`,`Statistics, probability, and data interpretation`,`Problem-solving strategies and mathematical logic`,`Applied mathematics project and assessment`]},{slug:`physics`,code:`02`,title:`Physics`,description:`Explore how the physical world works through motion, forces, energy, waves, electricity, and scientific investigation. The course connects foundational theory to observable everyday phenomena.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Academics`,modules:[`Scientific measurement, units, and vectors`,`Motion, speed, velocity, and acceleration`,`Forces, Newton’s laws, and equilibrium`,`Work, energy, power, and momentum`,`Properties of matter, pressure, and fluids`,`Waves, sound, and light`,`Electricity, circuits, and magnetism`,`Experimental investigation and final problem set`]},{slug:`chemistry`,code:`03`,title:`Chemistry`,description:`Understand matter, atoms, chemical reactions, and the principles behind materials and substances. Learners practice interpreting formulas, balancing equations, and connecting chemistry to daily life.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Academics`,modules:[`Laboratory safety, measurement, and matter`,`Atoms, elements, isotopes, and the periodic table`,`Electron structure and chemical bonding`,`Chemical formulas and nomenclature`,`Balancing equations and reaction types`,`Moles, stoichiometry, and concentration`,`Acids, bases, and pH`,`Chemistry in everyday life and practical assessment`]},{slug:`biology`,code:`04`,title:`Biology`,description:`Discover living systems, from cells and genetics to ecosystems and evolution. The course introduces biological vocabulary and scientific thinking through familiar examples and simple investigations.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Academics`,modules:[`Characteristics of life and scientific method`,`Cell structure and function`,`Biomolecules, enzymes, and metabolism`,`Cell division and reproduction`,`Genetics, DNA, and inheritance`,`Evolution and biodiversity`,`Human body systems and homeostasis`,`Ecosystems, conservation, and final project`]},{slug:`computer-science`,code:`05`,title:`Computer Science`,description:`Develop a clear understanding of how computers represent information and how software and networks work. Learners gain a foundation in computational thinking, algorithms, and digital systems.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:36,category:`Technology`,modules:[`Computer hardware, software, and operating systems`,`Data representation: binary, text, and media`,`Computational thinking and decomposition`,`Algorithms, flowcharts, and pseudocode`,`Programming concepts and control structures`,`Data structures and databases fundamentals`,`Networks, the internet, and cloud concepts`,`Software design, testing, and capstone`]},{slug:`python-programming`,code:`06`,title:`Python Programming`,description:`Learn to write useful programs with Python, progressing from first principles to reusable code, data handling, and a small portfolio project. Suitable for beginners with basic computer skills.`,duration:`10 weeks`,hours:40,category:`Technology`,modules:[`Python setup, syntax, and first programs`,`Variables, types, input, and output`,`Conditions and Boolean logic`,`Loops and iteration patterns`,`Strings, lists, tuples, and dictionaries`,`Functions, scope, and modular code`,`Files, exceptions, and debugging`,`Object-oriented programming fundamentals`,`Working with packages and APIs`,`Build and present a practical Python project`]},{slug:`data-science-analytics`,code:`07`,title:`Data Science & Analytics`,description:`Learn how to turn raw data into useful insights. Learners practice data preparation, exploratory analysis, visualization, basic statistics, and communicating evidence-based findings.`,duration:`10 weeks`,hours:40,category:`Technology`,modules:[`Data science workflow and analytical questions`,`Spreadsheets, data types, and data quality`,`Python and notebook workflow`,`Data cleaning and transformation`,`Exploratory data analysis`,`Descriptive statistics and probability basics`,`Data visualization and dashboard principles`,`Correlation and introductory predictive thinking`,`Communicating insights and avoiding misleading charts`,`End-to-end analytics project`]},{slug:`artificial-intelligence`,code:`08`,title:`Artificial Intelligence`,description:`Get an accessible introduction to artificial intelligence, machine learning, generative AI, and responsible use. Learners understand common AI workflows and build a small applied concept or prototype.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Technology`,modules:[`What AI is: history, terminology, and applications`,`Data, features, and the machine-learning workflow`,`Supervised and unsupervised learning concepts`,`Model training, testing, and evaluation`,`Neural networks and deep-learning overview`,`Generative AI, language models, and prompting`,`AI ethics, privacy, bias, and safety`,`Design an AI-assisted solution concept`]},{slug:`cybersecurity`,code:`09`,title:`Cybersecurity`,description:`Build practical awareness of digital threats and the habits that reduce risk. The course introduces security principles, account protection, networks, privacy, and incident response in a defensive, ethical context.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Technology`,modules:[`Cybersecurity principles and threat landscape`,`Passwords, passkeys, and multi-factor authentication`,`Phishing, social engineering, and scam awareness`,`Device, browser, and software security`,`Network security and safe Wi-Fi practices`,`Data privacy, backups, and encryption basics`,`Recognizing incidents and responding safely`,`Personal security plan and defensive assessment`]},{slug:`web-development`,code:`10`,title:`Web Development`,description:`Create modern websites by learning how the web works and how to structure, style, and add interaction to pages. Learners finish with a responsive multi-page website.`,duration:`10 weeks`,hours:40,category:`Technology`,modules:[`How the web works: browsers, servers, and URLs`,`HTML structure, semantic elements, and accessibility`,`CSS selectors, typography, color, and layout`,`Responsive design and mobile-first principles`,`JavaScript fundamentals and DOM interaction`,`Forms, validation, and user experience`,`APIs, JSON, and asynchronous requests`,`Version control and deployment basics`,`Web performance, testing, and accessibility review`,`Build and publish a responsive website`]},{slug:`business-fundamentals`,code:`11`,title:`Business Fundamentals`,description:`Understand the essential functions of an organization and how businesses create, deliver, and capture value. Learners explore customers, operations, finance, teams, and strategy.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Business`,modules:[`Business models and value creation`,`Customers, markets, and competitive positioning`,`Marketing and sales fundamentals`,`Operations, processes, and quality`,`Finance, budgets, revenue, and costs`,`People, teams, and leadership`,`Business strategy and performance indicators`,`Business case study and presentation`]},{slug:`entrepreneurship-startups`,code:`12`,title:`Entrepreneurship & Startups`,description:`Turn an idea into a tested business opportunity. Learners explore customer discovery, value propositions, business models, basic financial planning, and pitching.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Business`,modules:[`Entrepreneurial mindset and opportunity discovery`,`Customer problems, interviews, and validation`,`Value propositions and target segments`,`Competitor research and market sizing`,`Business models and revenue streams`,`Minimum viable products and experimentation`,`Startup budgeting, pricing, and unit economics`,`Pitch deck and venture action plan`]},{slug:`digital-marketing`,code:`13`,title:`Digital Marketing`,description:`Plan and evaluate digital campaigns across search, social media, content, email, and paid channels. Learners practice audience definition, content planning, analytics, and campaign optimization.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Business`,modules:[`Digital marketing ecosystem and customer journey`,`Audience research and positioning`,`Content strategy and editorial calendars`,`Social media platforms and community management`,`Search engine optimization fundamentals`,`Email marketing and landing pages`,`Paid advertising and campaign budgeting`,`Analytics, reporting, and campaign project`]},{slug:`personal-finance-investing`,code:`14`,title:`Personal Finance & Investing`,description:`Develop practical money-management skills, from budgeting and saving to understanding risk, debt, and long-term investing principles. Educational content only; it does not provide personalized financial advice.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:28,category:`Business`,modules:[`Financial goals and money mindset`,`Budgeting, cash flow, and expense tracking`,`Saving, emergency funds, and banking`,`Understanding debt, interest, and credit`,`Inflation, compounding, and time value of money`,`Investment types, diversification, and risk`,`Fraud awareness and financial protection`,`Build a personal financial learning plan`]},{slug:`graphic-design`,code:`15`,title:`Graphic Design`,description:`Learn the visual principles used to create clear and compelling graphics. Learners practice composition, typography, color, image selection, and a consistent design workflow.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Design & Communication`,modules:[`Design process, audience, and visual communication`,`Composition, hierarchy, balance, and alignment`,`Typography and font pairing`,`Color theory and accessible contrast`,`Shapes, icons, and illustration basics`,`Image editing and asset preparation`,`Brand identity and social media graphics`,`Portfolio project and design critique`]},{slug:`business-english-communication`,code:`16`,title:`Business English & Communication`,description:`Improve the English used in professional settings. Learners practice clear writing, meetings, presentations, workplace vocabulary, email etiquette, and cross-cultural communication.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Design & Communication`,modules:[`Professional vocabulary and tone`,`Writing clear business emails`,`Grammar for workplace communication`,`Meetings, discussion, and active listening`,`Presentations and public speaking`,`Reports, summaries, and proposals`,`Negotiation and cross-cultural communication`,`Professional communication portfolio`]},{slug:`productivity-time-mastery`,code:`17`,title:`Productivity & Time Mastery`,description:`Build sustainable systems for planning work, managing attention, prioritizing tasks, and completing goals. The focus is on practical routines rather than unrealistic productivity promises.`,duration:`4 weeks`,hours:16,category:`Life & Wellbeing`,modules:[`Goals, priorities, and personal workflow audit`,`Planning, calendars, and time blocking`,`Task management and prioritization methods`,`Focus, attention, and distraction management`,`Breaking projects into manageable actions`,`Habits, review routines, and avoiding burnout`,`Digital tools and simple automation`,`Create a personal productivity system`]},{slug:`language-learning`,code:`18`,title:`Language Learning`,description:`Learn how to approach a new language with effective study strategies. The course covers vocabulary, pronunciation, listening, reading, speaking, and building a consistent practice routine.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:24,category:`Design & Communication`,modules:[`Setting goals and choosing learning resources`,`Pronunciation, sounds, and listening habits`,`High-frequency vocabulary and spaced review`,`Grammar patterns in context`,`Reading strategies and comprehension`,`Speaking practice and conversation strategies`,`Writing, feedback, and error correction`,`Build a personal language-learning plan`]},{slug:`environmental-science`,code:`19`,title:`Environmental Science`,description:`Explore the relationships between people and the natural environment. Learners study ecosystems, climate, resources, pollution, sustainability, and practical ways to evaluate environmental choices.`,duration:`8 weeks`,hours:32,category:`Academics`,modules:[`Earth systems and environmental science basics`,`Ecosystems, biodiversity, and food webs`,`Climate systems and climate change`,`Water, soil, and natural resources`,`Energy sources and sustainability`,`Air, water, and land pollution`,`Waste reduction and circular economy`,`Local environmental action project`]},{slug:`health-wellness`,code:`20`,title:`Health & Wellness`,description:`Understand the foundations of everyday wellbeing, including sleep, nutrition, movement, stress management, and healthy routines. This is general education, not medical diagnosis or treatment.`,duration:`6 weeks`,hours:24,category:`Life & Wellbeing`,modules:[`Wellness foundations and personal goals`,`Nutrition basics and balanced eating patterns`,`Physical activity and movement habits`,`Sleep, recovery, and daily routines`,`Stress awareness and healthy coping strategies`,`Digital wellbeing and social connection`,`Health information literacy and misinformation`,`Create a realistic personal wellness plan`]}].map(e=>({...e,cover:`/courses/${e.slug}.webp`,outcome:`Learners should be able to explain the key concepts, complete the practical activities, and present the final exercise or project for this course.`})),n=t.reduce((e,t)=>e+t.hours,0);t.reduce((e,t)=>e+t.modules.length,0);function r(e){return t.find(t=>t.slug===e)}export{n as i,t as n,r,e as t};
